WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  components/ai/AIDriveCoaching.tsx — the visible AI surface for the drive-detail page, an opt-in narrative card
  layered alongside (NOT replacing) the deterministic per-drive stat cards / hero gauges / energy summary.

    export const AIDriveCoaching = withAiFeature('drive-coaching', InnerSection)
      withAiFeature (components/ai/withAiFeature.tsx): returns null unless useAiEnabled('drive-coaching') is on
        (ADR-015 §I5/§I6). On = renders InnerSection inside a div carrying data-ai-feature="drive-coaching".
      InnerSection({ driveId?: string }):
        url   = driveId ? `/ai/drives/${encodeURIComponent(driveId)}/coach` : '/ai/drives/0/coach'
        stream = useAiStream({ url, body: {}, onEvent: () => {} })   // POST SSE, empty body
        renders <AIFeatureCard title="Drive coaching" description=<2-4 para blurb>
                 buttonLabel="Generate coaching" badgeLabel="Helix" canStart={!!driveId} stream={stream}/>
  components/ai/AIFeatureCard.tsx — GlassPanel → header (title + AIBadge "Helix" + description + optional emptyHint
    when !canStart) → action Button → AiOutputPanel. The visible CTA label is the brand-constant "Ask Helix" (idle)
    / "Helix is thinking…" + AIThinkingDots (streaming); aria-label = "Ask Helix · {buttonLabel}". disabled =
    !canStart || isStreaming.
  hooks/useAiStream.ts — AiStreamState = idle | streaming | paused-confirm | done | error. The coaching flow drives
    idle → streaming → done|error (its onEvent is a no-op; delta frames accumulate into stream.text). start() sets
    state='streaming'+text=''; 'delta' appends; 'done' settles; non-2xx start → 'stream_http_{status}' error;
    AbortError → back to idle.
  components/ai/AiOutputPanel.tsx — hidden when idle & text empty; AIThinkingIndicator (shimmer lines + "Helix is
    thinking" + dots) while streaming & text empty; whitespace-pre-wrap prose otherwise; "Helix error: {msg}" on error.
  i18n keys: driveDetail.aiCoaching.title/description/generateButton/badge + the shared helix.askHelix /
    helix.thinking / helix.errorLabel + ai.common.errorUnknown.

